    /// Attempt to convert the internal buffer into a [SocketAddr] object
    ///
    /// The internal buffer is assumed to be a [sockaddr].
    ///
    /// If the value of `.sa_family` resolves to `AF_INET` or `AF_INET6` then the buffer is
